WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.734 --> 00:00:17.413
Bello: Ugh, this stuff is really sticky.

2
00:00:17.414 --> 00:00:20.808
Tina: Yeah, it's kind of gross.

3
00:00:20.809 --> 00:00:23.918
Danny: I think it's kind of cool.

4
00:00:23.919 --> 00:00:33.210
Dave: Hasn't anyone told you not to play with your food!

5
00:00:33.211 --> 00:00:37.847
Brad: That was a big bump.

6
00:00:37.848 --> 00:00:39.622
Bello: Quick, help me.

7
00:00:39.623 --> 00:00:44.257
Tina: Hang on, Danny.

8
00:00:44.258 --> 00:00:49.443
Bello: Hold on tight.

9
00:00:49.444 --> 00:00:51.444
Danny: That was dangerous.

10
00:00:51.445 --> 00:00:55.357
Bello: We should get off the side of the wagon.

11
00:00:55.358 --> 00:00:57.179
Chuck: I agree!

12
00:00:57.180 --> 00:01:05.593
Tina: Let's jump inside.

13
00:01:05.594 --> 00:01:09.571
Brad: Your neighbor is really pulling this wagon fast.

14
00:01:09.572 --> 00:01:13.133
Dave: Why is she so interested in your wagon anyway?

15
00:01:13.134 --> 00:01:15.914
Tina: Mrs. Rice is always snooping.

16
00:01:15.915 --> 00:01:18.881
She saw Bello and me outside my house.

17
00:01:18.882 --> 00:01:21.569
Tina: She was so scared that she fainted.

18
00:01:21.570 --> 00:01:24.400
I guess she's been following me.

19
00:01:24.401 --> 00:01:27.590
Chuck: Why was she scared of Bello?

20
00:01:27.591 --> 00:01:30.416
Bello: I'm a giant, remember?

21
00:01:30.417 --> 00:01:32.065
Dave: We keep forgetting.

22
00:01:32.066 --> 00:01:34.560
We've never seen you when you're big.

23
00:01:34.561 --> 00:01:37.817
Danny: You'll see when we get to Brad's garage.

24
00:01:37.818 --> 00:01:40.910
Brad: We need to get Mrs. Rice to stop soon.

25
00:01:40.911 --> 00:01:43.017
Bello: How are we going to do that?

26
00:01:43.018 --> 00:01:45.757
Tina: Let's see if we can get her attention.

27
00:01:45.758 --> 00:01:52.724
Danny: Everybody yell.

28
00:01:52.725 --> 00:01:56.471
Mrs. Rice: What's that squeaking noise?

29
00:01:56.472 --> 00:02:01.290
Mrs. Rice: No, no. It sounds more like a chirping noise.

30
00:02:01.291 --> 00:02:03.887
Mrs. Rice: It's coming from the wagon.

31
00:02:03.888 --> 00:02:06.825
Wait a minute, what do we have here?

32
00:02:06.826 --> 00:02:14.953
Mrs. Rice: It looks like some filthy bugs.

33
00:02:14.954 --> 00:02:18.143
Chuck: She's putting her glasses on.

34
00:02:18.144 --> 00:02:21.204
Bello: What if she recognizes me?

35
00:02:21.205 --> 00:02:26.989
Danny: Quick, everybody hide.

36
00:02:26.990 --> 00:02:28.695
Dave: I've got an idea.

37
00:02:28.696 --> 00:02:30.428
You go to that corner.

38
00:02:30.429 --> 00:02:36.746
I'll go to this corner.

39
00:02:36.747 --> 00:02:39.374
Chuck: Now what?

40
00:02:39.375 --> 00:02:47.883
Dave: Grab the corner of the sheet and do what I do.

41
00:02:47.884 --> 00:02:52.372
Mrs. Rice: Now, where did those bugs go?

42
00:02:52.373 --> 00:02:57.527
Dave: Jump!

43
00:02:57.528 --> 00:03:02.951
Chuck: Awesome! We're flying.

44
00:03:02.952 --> 00:03:13.455
Brad: Everybody hang on.

45
00:03:13.456 --> 00:03:16.090
Tina: She can't see anything now.

46
00:03:16.091 --> 00:03:18.602
Danny: That was a great idea.

47
00:03:18.603 --> 00:03:22.629
Dave: Well, as Bello said, we all have to work together.

48
00:03:22.630 --> 00:03:24.446
Brad: This is my driveway.

49
00:03:24.447 --> 00:03:28.618
Everybody follow me.

50
00:03:28.619 --> 00:03:35.817
Mrs. Rice: Help, help! I can't see.

51
00:03:35.818 --> 00:03:42.062
Mrs. Rice: Now I know something strange is happening around here!
